          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We got tired of “healthy” bakery food that tasted like a compromise, and we got tired of “tasty” bakery food that came loaded with stuff we couldn't pronounce. So we picked a side: real ingredients, honest labels, nothing hiding behind a health-food halo.</p>",
