      "blocks": {
        "mission_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every cake, bun, and loaf we bake is built around one question: does this actually make someone's day a little better — not just their cheat day, their regular day? If the answer's no, it doesn't leave our kitchen.</p><p>We're based in Tamil Nadu, baking in small batches and getting it to you fresh — because better living doesn't come from a box that's been sitting on a shelf for a month. It comes from bread that's still warm when you get to it.</p>",
