          "settings": {
            "heading": "What “better living” actually means to us",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "meaning_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>No maida, no trans fat — not marketing copy, just what's in the recipe.</li><li>Freshness over shelf life. Shorter expiry, zero shortcuts. That's the trade we're happy to make.</li><li>Claims we can back. If it's on the badge, it's on the ingredient list.</li></ul>",
